Alphich third-party notices

The current company-data runtime uses the Python standard library.

setuptools is declared as the packaging/build tool in backend/pyproject.toml.
It is not vendored. Upstream project and license information:
https://github.com/pypa/setuptools

The organizer company CSV files are external runtime inputs. They are not
included in this repository. Their source and schema are documented in
docs/research.md. This repository does not grant redistribution rights to
those inputs.

Files in data/synthetic are fictional examples created for this project.
They contain no copied company records from the organizer data.

The offline PDF preparation package is separate from the company-data runtime.
Its exact Python dependency versions are recorded in knowledge/requirements.lock.
Installed distribution metadata lists these licenses:
