Retain the license files distributed with those packages when distributing them.

PDF rendering uses the separately installed Poppler CLI (GPL-2.0-or-later):
https://poppler.freedesktop.org/
OCR uses the separately installed Tesseract CLI (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract
