https://huggingface.co/intfloat/multilingual-e5-base
The model card declares MIT. The optional retrieval package runs the official
ONNX INT8 export locally; its revision and checksums are recorded separately in
knowledge/embedding-model.json. Model weights are not committed to Git.
No generative model is included or invoked by this package. OCR/tokenizer
asset URLs and checksums are in knowledge/assets.json.

